msgid "a11yfy Settings"
msgstr "a11yfy iestatījumi"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:22
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Savienojums"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:28
msgid "Connect to a11yfy"
msgstr "Izveidot savienojumu ar a11yfy"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:32
msgid "One click: log in or register on a11yfy.com, approve the access, done. Alternatively, paste an API key below."
msgstr ""
"Vienu klikšķi: ieejiet vai reģistrējieties vietnē a11yfy.com, apstipriniet piekļuvi, un viss. Vai arī ievietojiet API "
"atslēgu zemāk."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:38
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API atslēga"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:43
msgid "connected"
msgstr "savienots"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:47
msgid "Disconnect (remove the stored key)"
msgstr "Atvienot (izdzēst saglabāto atslēgu)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:49
msgid "To replace the key, paste a new one below."
msgstr "Lai aizstātu atslēgu, ielīmējiet jaunu zemāk."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:57
#. translators: %s: link to the a11yfy account page.
msgid "Create a key on %s under Account → API keys. The key is stored encrypted and is never sent to the browser."
msgstr ""
"Izveidojiet atslēgu %s sadaļā „Konta” → „API atslēgas”. Atslēga tiek glabāta šifrētā veidā un nekad netiek nosūtīta "
"pārlūkprogrammai."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:66
msgid "Status updates"
msgstr "Stāvokļa atjauninājumi"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:69
msgid "Instant (webhook) — a11yfy notifies this site the moment a job finishes; polling remains as a safety net."
msgstr ""
"Tūlītēji (webhook) — a11yfy paziņo šai vietnei, tiklīdz uzdevums ir pabeigts; regulārā pārbaude paliek kā drošības "
"pasākums."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:71
msgid ""
"Polling — the site checks job status in the background. Reconnecting via the button flow enables instant webhook "
"updates when your site is publicly reachable."
msgstr ""
"Pārbaude — vietne fonā pārbauda uzdevuma statusu. Atkārtota savienošanās, izmantojot pogu secību, nodrošina tūlītējus "
"webhook atjauninājumus, kad jūsu vietne ir publiski pieejama."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:81
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Režīms"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:87
msgid "new PDF uploads are made accessible automatically."
msgstr "jauni augšupielādētie PDF faili kļūst pieejami automātiski."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:92
msgid "you pick what to fix in the Media Library or on the Dashboard."
msgstr "jūs izvēlaties, ko labot multivides bibliotēkā vai vadības panelī."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:102
msgid "Remediation pauses when this many credits were spent in a calendar month. 0 = no cap."
msgstr "Sanācija tiek apturēta, ja kalendārajā mēnesī ir iztērēts šāds kredītu skaits. 0 = nav ierobežojuma."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:106
msgid "Low-credit warning below"
msgstr "Zemā kredītspējas brīdinājums zemāk"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:110
msgid "Admin notice + email when the balance drops below this. 0 = off."
msgstr "Paziņojums administratoriem + e-pasts, ja atlikums nokrīt zem šīs summas. 0 = izslēgts."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:114
msgid "Saving strategy"
msgstr "Uzkrājumu veidošanas stratēģija"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:119
msgid "Replace in place (recommended)"
msgstr "Aizstāt, nemainot atrašanās vietu (ieteicams)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:120
msgid "same URL, original kept as a backup with one-click restore."
msgstr "tā pati URL adrese, oriģināls tiek saglabāts kā rezerves kopija, ko var atjaunot ar vienu klikšķi."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:124
msgid "Conservative"
msgstr "Konservatīvais"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:125
msgid "the original file is never touched; links are swapped when pages render."
msgstr "oriģinālais fails netiek mainīts; saites tiek aizstātas, kad lapas tiek attēlotas."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:131
msgid "Notification email"
msgstr "Paziņojuma e-pasts"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:136
msgid "Low-credit and failure notifications. Empty = site admin email."
msgstr "Paziņojumi par zemu kredītpunktu skaitu un neveiksmēm. Tukšs = vietnes administratora e-pasts."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:140
msgid "On plugin deletion"
msgstr "Par spraudņa dzēšanu"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:145
msgid "Keep the remediated PDFs (recommended — they are your content)."
msgstr "Saglabājiet labotos PDF failus (ieteicams — tie ir jūsu saturs)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:149
msgid "Restore the original files from backup."
msgstr "Atjaunojiet sākotnējos failus no rezerves kopijas."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:156
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Saglabāt iestatījumus"

#: includes/class-a11yfy-api-client.php:102
msgid "The PDF file could not be read from disk."
msgstr "PDF failu neizdevās nolasīt no diska."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-api-client.php:125
msgid "No a11yfy API key configured."
msgstr "Nav konfigurēts a11yfy API atslēgas kods."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-api-client.php:185
#. translators: %d: HTTP status code.
msgid "a11yfy API error (HTTP %d)."
msgstr "a11yfy API kļūda (HTTP %d)."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-connect.php:39
#: includes/class-a11yfy-connect.php:64
msgid "You are not allowed to connect this site."
msgstr "Šo vietni nav atļauts pieslēgt."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:27
msgid "The attachment file is not available on the local filesystem."
msgstr "Pievienotais fails nav pieejams vietējā failu sistēmā."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:33
msgid "This PDF is larger than 50 MB — above the current processing limit."
msgstr "Šī PDF faila izmērs pārsniedz 50 MB — tas ir lielāks par pašreizējo apstrādes limitu."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:40
msgid "Not enough PHP memory to upload this PDF safely. Raise memory_limit or process a smaller file."
msgstr ""
"PHP atmiņas nepietiek, lai droši augšupielādētu šo PDF failu. Palieliniet `memory_limit` vai augšupielādējiet mazāku "
"failu."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:46
msgid "The monthly credit cap set for this site has been reached."
msgstr "Ir sasniegts šai vietnei noteiktais ikmēneša kredītu limits."

#: includes/class-a11yfy-guardrails.php:53
msgid "This PDF already passed the accessibility pre-check — skipping to avoid unnecessary credit use."
msgstr ""
